     "habitat",
     "adaptation",
     "survive"
    ],
    "text": {
     "en": "A habitat is the place where an organism lives. Habitats can be land, water, desert, forest, mountain or polar.\nAn adaptation is a feature or behaviour that helps an organism survive in its habitat. A camel stores fat in its hump and has wide feet for sand. A fish has gills and fins.\nPlants adapt too. Cactus has thick stems to store water and spines instead of leaves."
    }
